{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53679","headline":"偈 · 德诚","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本是钓鱼船上客，偶力须发着袈裟。\n佛祖位中留不住，夜深依旧宿芦花。\n（见明杨慎《艺林伐山》卷十七《船子和尚四偈》）（〖1〗施蛰存先生云：「此首杨升庵所录四偈之三，疑是僞作。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"德诚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53679.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53679","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}